==Battleground==
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 31.67 seconds<sup>950f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 35 seconds<sup>1,050f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
This stage is not too difficult. Spawn a [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], and get ready to spam 3 meatshields. Anti-Floating units make this even easier, so if you have [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]] cat, use it.

